[38;5;231m●[39m 1. Start a new session: [38;5;153mtmux new-session -s name[39m                            
  2. List all sessions: [38;5;153mtmux list-sessions[39m                                    
  3. Attach to a session: [38;5;153mtmux attach -t name[39m                                 
  4. Detach from current session: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mD[39m                               
  5. Kill a session: [38;5;153mtmux kill-session -t name[39m                                
  6. Rename a session: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m$[39m   
  7. Create a new window: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mC
[39m  8. List windows: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mW[39m       
  9. Next window: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mN[39m        
  10. Previous window: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mP[39m   
  11. Jump to window 0-9: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then number                                  
  12. Kill current window: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m&[39m                                      
  13. Rename window: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m,[39m     
  14. Split pane vertically: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m%[39m                                    
  15. Split pane horizontally: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m"[39m                                  
  16. Navigate panes: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then arrow keys                                  
  17. Close pane: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mX[39m        
  18. Maximize pane: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mZ[39m     
  19. Resize pane: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mCtrl+Arrow[39m                                     
  20. Show pane numbers: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153mQ[39m 
  21. Enter copy mode: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m[[39m   
  22. Paste from buffer: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m][39m 
  23. List buffers: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m#[39m      
  24. Choose buffer: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m=[39m     
  25. Synchronize panes: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m:[39m then [38;5;153msetw synchronize-panes on[39m         
  26. Break pane to new window: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m![39m                                 
  27. Join pane to window: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m:[39m then [38;5;153mjoin-pane -t target[39m             
  28. Send command to pane: [38;5;153mtmux send-keys -t session:pane "command" Enter[39m    
  29. List key bindings: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m?[39m 
  30. Reload config: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m:[39m then [38;5;153msource-file ~/.tmux.conf[39m              
  31. Scroll in pane: [38;5;153mCtrl+B[39m then [38;5;153m[[39m then arrow keys                           
  32. Set custom prefix: [38;5;153mset -g prefix C-a[39m in config                          
  33. Bind custom key: [38;5;153mbind-key -n C-x command[39m in config                      
  34. New session with command: [38;5;153mtmux new-session -d -s name "command"[39m         
  35. Split window vertically (alt): [38;5;153mtmux split-window -h[39m                     
  36. Split window horizontally (alt): [38;5;153mtmux split-window -v[39m                   
